hpc-eff (0.6-1) experimental; urgency=medium

  * CO2-only regulation via Wattnet by default (login with WATTNET_EMAIL and
    WATTNET_PASSWORD, 24 h token cached); Nowtricity removed.
  * CO2 threshold mode: [CO2_API] THRESHOLD (default 430 g/kWh) with HYSTERESIS.
  * Plugin pipeline: [PIPELINE] read/score/act/record, executable plugins.

 -- CESNET <pailozian@cesnet.cz>  Mon, 26 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0100

hpc-eff (0.5-1) experimental; urgency=medium

  * Added configurable CO2 API backend: Nowtricity (default) or Wattnet.
  * Introduced [CO2_API] section with TYPE selector (nowtricity|wattnet).
  * Nowtricity settings: BASE_URL, ZONE, USER_AGENT, API_KEY (unified prefix).
  * Wattnet settings: URL, API_KEY, ZONE, FOOTPRINT_TYPE, SCOPE.
  * Removed hardcoded Nowtricity API URLs — configurable via config.ini.

 -- CESNET <vondruska@cesnet.cz>  Mon, 17 Aug 2026 13:30:00 +0200

hpc-eff (0.4-1) experimental; urgency=medium

  * Unified CO₂/price and temperature regulation into single codebase.
  * Added [MODE] control_mode preset (temperature|co2|both).
  * Implemented custom temperature reader hook (TYPE=custom).
  * Dual packaging: RPM (AlmaLinux/RHEL) + DEB (Debian/Ubuntu).
  * Independent feature flags: ENABLE_SET_CPU, ENABLE_CPU_THERMO.
  * Temperature threshold override (hard limit on CPU frequency).
  * Centralized command execution (system_utils.py).
  * Robust frequency parsing (GHz/MHz/kHz support).
  * Unified database schema with temperature column.

 -- CESNET <pailozian@cesnet.cz>  Tue, 16 Jun 2026 12:00:00 +0200

hpc-eff (0.3-1) experimental; urgency=medium

  * Implemented modular temperature reading system with pluggable sources.
  * Added support for HTTP API temperature sensors with JSON path extraction.
  * Maintained backward compatibility with IPMI sensor configuration.
  * Centralized utilities to eliminate code duplication (freq_to_khz, get_cpu_count).
  * Implemented dependency injection for configuration management.
  * Created controller orchestration layer with conditional feature execution.
  * Added CLI flags for cron job management (--enable/--disable).
  * Integrated cron control into Debian package hooks (postinst/prerm).
  * Optimized data gathering to skip unnecessary API calls when features disabled.
  * Fixed Python 3.7+ type annotation compatibility.

 -- CESNET <vondruska@cesnet.cz>  Sun, 23 Feb 2026 14:30:00 +0100

hpc-eff (0.2-1) experimental; urgency=medium

  * Integrated JSON logging feature for evaluation state and history.
  * Refactored core logic into controller.py for better modularity.
  * Added temperature-based CPU frequency control.
  * Enhanced static context with power command and active plugins.

